    <div class="hint">These only add a way in — the password field always keeps working. Status is read live from <code>omaface</code>, <code>omarchy-hw-fingerprint</code> and <code>fprintd</code>, so a machine without the hardware is told plainly rather than offered a switch that cannot work.</div>
